@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home - Child Care Licensing</PageTitle>

<h1>Licence your child care centre</h1>

<p class="lead">
    This demo portal lets an operator register a facility, review room capacity against
    provincial-style rules, and submit a licence application for ministry review.
</p>

<section aria-labelledby="quick-start-heading">
    <h2 id="quick-start-heading">Quick start</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Open <a href="/facilities">My facilities</a> to see your registered centres.</li>
        <li>Select a facility to review rooms and run capacity validation.</li>
        <li>Submit the application when all rooms pass the rules check.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="sample-heading">
    <h2 id="sample-heading">Sample data</h2>
    <p>
        Development mode includes
        <strong>Sunshine Early Learning Centre</strong> in Toronto with two rooms ready for validation.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/facilities/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/application">
        Open sample application
    </a>
</section>
